    "bbox": [
      173.61,
      222.65,
      390.11,
      233.99
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE JUDICATURE ACT, NO. 2 OF 1978",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.13,
      401.91,
      275.15
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      291.17,
      401.89,
      316.19
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Judicature (Amendment)Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      332.33,
      401.85,
      357.35
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 45 of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978 ishereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      373.37,
      401.86,
      412.19
    ],
    "text": "(i)by the repeal of subsection (2) of that section andthe substitution therefor of the following newsubsection:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.01,
      428.21,
      401.89,
      508.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2)The Minister may, from time to time by noticepublished in the Gazette, appoint such personsas shall be named in such notice to be Justicesof the Peace for the Republic of Sri Lanka orfor any administrative district as to theMinister shall seem expedient:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      221.85,
      524.09,
      401.89,
      672.47
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, where any appointmentof any Justice of the Peace has been madeprior to the date of coming into operation ofthis proviso for any zone, district or division,such appointment shall be deemed to havebeen made for the relevant administrativedistrict containing the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision within which the residence of suchJustice of the Peace was situated at the timeof appointment for such zone, district ordivision.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
